# Uncomment to build and run a release other than the one this repository
# declares. Left without a number on purpose: the version lives in the
# Dockerfile's ARG default, docker-compose.override.yml's fallback and tasks.py,
# all three guarded by tests/unit/test_pins.py. A literal here was a copy none of
# them knew about, handed to every fresh clone by `cp .env.example .env`.
# INFRAHUB_BASE_VERSION=
INFRAHUB_ADDRESS=http://localhost:8000
